{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1064.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"fa4d25a31325fcf4bf49f8bb5d4a94e8aeb43ab9644316d19d2e6f98604acc36","ja":"ヴィランとして","zh":"作为反派","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1064.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"81d50c7abb5e8671c7aa5e3b13c037fc207a4859e48d53548fd576ce9653ad17","ja":"数日後、育たちは、\nまた別のイベントステージに参加していた……","zh":"几天后，育她们\n又参加了另一场活动的舞台演出……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1064.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b586565526b0b0f71f8f838ad42ba3e06cf028b00ca7d4c8118b108a27f1b209","ja":"育、準備はいい？　その……今日の会場も、\n子どもたちが多いみたいだけど……。","zh":"育，准备好了吗？那个……今天的会场，\n好像也有很多小孩子呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1064.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"efee1566950b4fb305e06bbb07c808b89616b5324d94e1e6b45b1f89d9370f1b","ja":"うん！　わたし、思いっきりかっこよくて\n迫力があるダンスをするね！　イーサンみたいに！","zh":"嗯！我会跳得特别帅气、\n特别有气势的！就像伊森那样！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1064.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"629c8a811d917bfa08f2513ccb66657dbaf0ffe87b38d48a8b95136c0ec3e822","ja":"……ふふっ、そっか！　気合い十分ね！","zh":"……呵呵，这样啊！干劲十足呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1064.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"31606ee3d80b86f6ce1795f26f1fa064b9503e94e95ae088ba6911db1534a576","ja":"うん、わたし、気づいたんだ！　怖がられるくらい、\n思いっきりイーサン役をやればいいって！","zh":"嗯，我注意到了一点！只要全力以赴演好\n伊桑这个角色，让人感到害怕就行了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1064.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"fd239342850b6ab29edbc8cb936cc0a6dd826b0a7735083ed38ea5bba665d441","ja":"だから今日は、みんなをたくさん\n泣かせちゃうくらい、がんばるね！","zh":"所以今天，我会努力到\n把大家都感动哭的程度哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1064.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ec67552a87611de443c7a793759868fe697004232aa2fbc61949c37a78f5495c","ja":"……へへっ！　そうだな、\nアタシも負けてらんないよ！","zh":"……嘿嘿！说得也是，\n我也不能认输啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1064.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"9aaf971e465daf1e5fa59b02540c9ad8b22d5fee4d07f9f9fe541676e118c130","ja":"いつも以上に気合い入れて、いくぞー！","zh":"拿出比平时更足的干劲，上吧——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1064.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"fdf5e0b9e325e8035c1a0f0493d79cdbef9eaf0b0e13690691363a771ca10d55","ja":"わ、私も……ゼノビアになりきれば、\nお、思い切ったパフォーマンス、できる……かも……。","zh":"我、我也……只要彻底化身为洁诺比雅的话，\n说、说不定……就能做出大胆的演出了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1064.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"8c6fa95e5a44aadc4e995fe516b09dea3abed99e66616a08042e3919429ad5aa","ja":"あはっ☆　みんなやる気一杯なの！","zh":"啊哈☆　大家干劲满满呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1064.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"07afdab890a4ef11ec99349607656f1ee1dac0382ceb0df8847bd8a50624c957","ja":"きっと今日は、面白くて忘れられない\n最高のステージになりそうって思うな☆","zh":"我觉得今天一定会成为有趣又令人难忘的\n最棒的舞台哦☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1064.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"21bb0692f53406d2e05714b680555ab5e890a48c128d4fa576892846ef18d883","ja":"うん！　わたし、やってみる！\nイーサンの魅力、わかったから！","zh":"嗯！我要试试看！\n因为我已经明白伊森的魅力了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1064.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"cb6f47695169f13c527425f38e2c8e985ee9f2762bbb6258bf1c4feb1cfed1c8","ja":"わたし、前よりイーサンを演じることが\n大好きになったんだ！　だから……。","zh":"比起之前，我更加喜欢\n扮演伊桑了！所以……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1064.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"8484ca5140d194a5336200362ae55b2407dce4c3438785beece5d594cc66ba89","ja":"怖いけどかっこいい、とびっきりの\nヴィランのステージ、始めよっ！","zh":"虽然可怕但很帅气，超棒的反派舞台，\n开始吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
